{"sourceUrl":"https://ai4s.pkusz.edu.cn/info/1153/1385.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:23.211161+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://ai4s.pkusz.edu.cn/info/1153/1385.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span> 2025</span><span>年，面对智能时代的科学革命与产业变革，北京大学以前瞻视野在深圳研究生院创立了科学智能学院。作为<strong>全球首个</strong>以学科形式推进科学智能（</span><span>AI for Science</span><span>）建制化发展的高等教育平台，科学智能学院聚焦人工智能与基础科学的深度融合。学院将构建</span><span>“AI+</span><span>科学</span><span>”</span><span>双轨制导师培养体系，开拓科学原理与大数据深度融通的科研范式，打造开放协同的创新生态。通过加速科学发现进程，定义产业未来格局，着力培养具有国际视野、交叉学科背景与创新能力的前沿复合型人才。为促进全国各高校优秀大学生之间的交流，增进同学们对我院的了解，我们拟于</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>26</span><span>日</span><span>-28</span><span>日举办</span><span>“</span><span>全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营活动</span><span>”</span><span>，欢迎计算机、人工智能、数学、化学、材料、生物、微电子、物理、机械、化工、生命科学、医药类等相关专业的优秀大学生积极报名！</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>一、活动安排及活动人数（暂定）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span>夏令营时间：</span></strong><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>26</span><span>日</span><span>~7</span><span>月</span><span>28</span><span>日</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>活动人数：</span></strong><strong><span>150</span><span>人</span></strong><span>左右</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>活动安排：</span></strong><span>无特殊情况，夏令营采用线下形式举办。主要活动内容包括但不限于：</span></p>\n<p><span>1.</span><span>学院情况介绍及各课题组宣讲、师生交流；</span></p>\n<p><span>2.</span><span>实验室参观；</span></p>\n<p><span>3.</span><span>营员个人展示；</span></p>\n<p><span>4.</span><span>素质拓展。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>二、申请资格</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span>（一）营员对象</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1.</span><span>全国高校</span><span>2027</span><span>年应届本科毕业生，具有计算机、人工智能、数学、化学、材料、生物、微电子、物理、机械、化工、生命科学、医药类等相关专业背景的优先考虑。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>（二）入营条件</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1</span><span>、学习成绩优秀，综合素质高。</span></p>\n<p><span>2</span><span>、对专业有浓厚的兴趣，愿意从事科学研究工作。</span></p>\n<p><span>3</span><span>、英语水平（符合其中任何一项即可）</span></p>\n<p><span>a</span><span>）国家英语四级考试</span><span>500</span><span>分（含）以上；</span></p>\n<p><span>b</span><span>）国家英语六级考试成绩</span><span>425</span><span>分（含）以上；</span></p>\n<p><span>c</span><span>）国家英语专业四级、八级考试合格；</span></p>\n<p><span>d</span><span>）</span><span>WSK</span><span>（</span><span>PETS 5</span><span>）考试合格；</span></p>\n<p><span>e</span><span>）</span><span>TOEFL</span><span>成绩</span><span>100</span><span>分（含）以上（</span><span>IBT</span><span>）；</span></p>\n<p><span>f</span><span>）</span><span>GRE</span><span>成绩</span><span>320</span><span>分（含）以上；</span></p>\n<p><span>g</span><span>）雅思成绩（学术类）</span><span>6.0</span><span>分（含）以上；</span></p>\n<p><span></span></p>\n<p><span>h</span><span>）作为第一或第二作者（导师第一作者）在报考学科、专业或相近研究领域的期刊或会议发表过英文学术论文（</span><span>2020</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>1</span><span>日后发表）。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>注：</span></strong><span>如提交雅思和托福英语考试成绩，需提交</span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>1</span><span>日后的考试成绩，并且在资格审查阶段能够登录官方系统进行查验；英语四六级成绩报告扫描件需足够清晰，确保右下角查验二维码清晰可扫。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>三、申请流程</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span>（一）网上申报</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>北京大学</span><span>2026</span><span>年优秀大学生夏令营网上报名系统已开通，欢迎大家踊跃报名。报名网址为：</span><span><a href=\"https://admission.pku.edu.cn/applications/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://admission.pku.edu.cn/applications/</span></a></span><span>（建议使用谷歌、火狐浏览器）。注册登录后，选择夏令营模块，<strong>选择</strong></span><strong><span>“</span></strong><strong><span>北京大学科学智能学院</span></strong><strong><span>2026</span></strong><strong><span>年全国优秀大学生夏令营</span></strong><strong><span>”</span></strong><span>。请选择对应的专业进行填报。</span></p>\n<p><span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>申请专业：</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>科学智能（计算机科学与技术）</span></p>\n<p><span>科学智能（材料科学）</span></p>\n<p><span>科学智能（生物学）</span></p>\n<p><span>科学智能（化学）</span><span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>备注：</span></strong><span>关于系统申报，有任何疑问，请直接致电</span><span>0755-26037662</span><span>丁老师</span></p>\n<p><span>报名起止时间为</span><strong><span>2026</span></strong><span>年</span><strong><span>6</span></strong><span>月</span><strong><span>3</span></strong><span>日</span><strong><span>0:00</span></strong><span>至</span><strong><span>2026</span></strong><strong><span>年</span></strong><strong><span>7</span></strong><strong><span>月</span></strong><strong><span>1</span></strong><strong><span>日</span></strong><strong><span>23:59</span></strong><span>。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>（二）提交申请材料</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1</span><span>、电子档材料提交</span></p>\n<p><span>请于</span><strong><span>2026</span></strong><strong><span>年</span></strong><strong><span>7</span></strong><strong><span>月</span></strong><strong><span>1</span></strong><strong><span>日</span></strong><strong><span>23:59:59</span></strong><strong><span>前</span></strong><span>将以下</span><span>“</span><span>所需材料</span><span>”</span><span>的电子版（<strong>有签字的材料需签字后再扫描</strong>）按顺序<strong>整理成一份</strong></span><strong><span>PDF</span></strong><strong><span>文档（专家推荐信不用提交电子版），发送至邮箱</span></strong><strong><span>ai4s-admissions@pku.edu.cn</span></strong><strong><span>。</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>邮件主题及附件文件名请以</span><span>“</span><span>拟申请专业</span><span>-</span><span>姓名</span><span>-</span><span>所在学校</span><span>”</span><span>命名。如：科学智能（生物学）</span><span>-</span><span>张三</span><span>-</span><span>北京大学。</span></p>\n<p><span>2</span><span>、纸版材料提交</span></p>\n<p><span>入选营员需提交<strong>纸版材料</strong>，纸版材料请按以下</span><span>“</span><span>所需材料</span><span>”</span><span>顺序整理好，用燕尾夹夹好，<strong>入营报到时提交</strong>。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>纸版材料提交时需保证</span></strong><strong><span>2</span></strong><strong><span>封专家推荐信是密封状态。</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>全部申请材料一经收到，恕不退还。</span></p>\n<p><span>所需材料：</span></p>\n<p><span>1</span><span>、北京大学</span><span>2026</span><span>年全国优秀大学生夏令营申请表</span><span>1</span><span>份（网上填写生成，<strong>申请人签名需用黑色签字笔手签</strong>）；</span></p>\n<p><span>2</span><span>、个人陈述</span><span>1</span><span>份（模板从报名系统中下载，<strong>申请人签名需用黑色签字笔手签</strong>）；</span></p>\n<p><span>3</span><span>、专家推荐信</span><span>2</span><span>封（模板从报名系统中下载），均需副教授（含）及以上职称专家分别推荐（<strong>推荐信内容可以打印，推荐人签名需用黑色签字笔手签，用信封密封好，专家需在信封封口处签名</strong>）；</span></p>\n<p><span>4</span><span>、本科阶段包含所修全部课程的正式成绩单原件</span><span>1</span><span>份，需加盖学校教务处公章或成绩单证明专用章；</span></p>\n<p><span>5</span><span>、本科阶段成绩排名（如本科院校有内容基本一致但格式不同的成绩证明，也可直接使用作为证明材料）；</span></p>\n<p><span>6</span><span>、英语水平成绩证明（成绩单）；</span></p>\n<p><span>7</span><span>、其他证明材料（如获奖证书；各类证书；代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果等）。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>材料提交说明</span></strong><span>：</span></p>\n<p><span>1</span><span>、</span><span><strong>以上1~6为必须项</strong></span><span>，第</span><span>7</span><span>项由考生根据自身实际情况提交。</span></p>\n<p><span>2</span><span>、申请人须保证所有材料真实有效，若填报虚假信息、提供虚假申报材料等，取消入营资格。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>四、材料审核及选拔</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>我院专家工作小组将根据申请人提供的资料择优选拔营员，入营名单拟于</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月中在学院主页（</span><span>https://ai4s.pkusz.edu.cn/</span><span>）上公布，未接到入营通知的同学皆为未入选，不另行通知。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>五、活动费用</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>本次夏令营不收取任何费用。</span></p>\n<p><span>1.</span><span>交通住宿费：入选营员自理交通住宿费。</span></p>\n<p><span>2.</span><span>用餐费：我院统一安排营员在我院活动期间的用餐。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>六、联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>联系地址：深圳市南山区丽水路</span><span>2199</span><span>号北京大学深圳研究生院</span><span>B</span><span>栋</span><span>219</span><span>办公室</span></p>\n<p><span>丁老师：</span><span>0755-26037662</span></p>\n<p><span>E-mail</span><span>：</span><span>ai4s-admissions@pku.edu.cn</span></p>\n<p><span>更多信息请留意科学智能学院网站（</span><span>https://ai4s.pkusz.edu.cn/</span><span>）。</span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"1ac2111b48fac544132565f415679bd3c2f2615f4bc450c0a2099bcc22622afa","textLength":2198,"sourceSha256":"3c63065510b6207c766ec2d66d8bc27531294d014b4d8abf7165ce7993d7728b","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-81dc34ff08412274b5f7","title":"2026年北京大学科学智能学院关于举办“2026年全国优秀大学生夏令营”的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:23.211161+00:00"}
